WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:11.200
Let's seek the Lord together now for the beauty and purity that

2
00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:13.660
He always has desired for us. Let's pray.

3
00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:15.960
Father, I praise you.

4
00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:20.580
You've been so patiently, continually

5
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.080
preparing us for this moment.

6
00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:26.200
I praise you for the plan and the glory of your plan to bring about

7
00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:28.080
holiness in our lives

8
00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:33.180
for hundreds and even thousands of years before time

9
00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:34.730
began or the earth was created.

10
00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:38.480
I praise you that you draw us to holiness.

11
00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:42.300
You planned for holiness in my life, in the life of my prayer

12
00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:44.200
partner that's here praying with me today.

13
00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:47.960
I pray, O God, that you would take us to that place.

14
00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:51.900
Lord, we trust you. We rest ourselves in your hand.

15
00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:55.670
Every difficulty and trial and tribulation, every

16
00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:59.449
pain, every negative experience, every blessing,

17
00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:04.041
everything has been leading up to us being holy like you planned

18
00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:04.681
for us to be.

19
00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:08.800
Praise you, Father. I praise you for your eternal plan.

20
00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:12.580
I praise you for the glory and the beauty of your holiness, and that you have

21
00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:16.160
always intended to make us like that.

22
00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:20.840
So God, would you bring that holiness and that purity in

23
00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:24.880
your sight, that blamelessness, would you bring it to pass

24
00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:27.650
in our lives? You've been planning it forever,

25
00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:32.020
literally forever, and I rejoice in that, and I praise you.

26
00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:35.060
Oh, God, bring that holiness to pass.

27
00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:39.040
Thank you, Lord. Show us what's next. Open the doors.

28
00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:42.960
Open our eyes that we might see what is next and how to move forward.

29
00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:46.440
And if you'll show us that, we'll walk in it. We'll follow it.

30
00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:50.700
We'll pursue that holiness for all the days of our life.

31
00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:55.220
We pray that you do these things for us, demonstrate it for us, and we will

32
00:01:55.560 --> 00:01:58.680
achieve that which you have always planned eternally for us to be.

33
00:01:58.840 --> 00:01:59.800
In Jesus' name.

34
00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:04.420
Now, I'd encourage you to continue to pray. Seek the Lord with your own words.

35
00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:08.260
Maybe you have particular things you need to ask Him about.

36
00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:12.080
Maybe there's particular ways in which you need to pray and remind yourself

37
00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:16.620
of the glory of His plan that He's always intended to bring about in

38
00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:18.300
your life. Let's keep praying.
